@aspect_bias_risk text
Use this aspect when the task should surface bias-sensitive or selection-risk context that a narrow technical retrieval might miss.
@aspect_bias_risk:meta json
{
  "rev": 1,
  "status": "approved",
  "aspect_type": "bias_oriented",
  "title": "Bias and selection risk",
  "summary": "Select KUs that warn about interpretive bias, selection bias, or omission risk for the current task.",
  "priority": 5,
  "domains": ["runtime", "policy", "knowledge"],
  "commands": ["planning", "kb", "credibility"],
  "interpreters": ["AdvancedReasoner", "deepLLM"],
  "tags": ["bias", "risk", "omission"],
  "query_terms": ["bias", "selection", "omission", "caution", "risk"]
}
@aspect_bias_risk:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by the interpretive or selection risks they help surface.
@aspect_bias_risk:inclusion text
Include KUs that warn about omitted context, selection bias, automation bias, or institutional bias.
@aspect_bias_risk:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that merely use the word bias without explaining a concrete interpretive risk.
@aspect_bias_risk:protocol text
Prefer KUs that should cause the runtime or operator to treat other evidence cautiously rather than taking it at face value.
@aspect_bias_risk:role_vocabulary json
["bias warning", "selection-risk note", "cautionary context"]
@aspect_bias_risk:query_terms json
["bias", "selection", "omission", "caution", "risk"]

@aspect_evidence_status text
Use this aspect when the task needs evidence, assumptions, uncertainty markers, or methodological caution around a claim.
@aspect_evidence_status:meta json
{
  "rev": 1,
  "status": "approved",
  "aspect_type": "epistemological",
  "title": "Evidence and assumptions",
  "summary": "Select KUs that act as evidence, assumption notes, method notes, or uncertainty markers for the current task.",
  "priority": 6,
  "domains": ["runtime", "knowledge", "evaluation"],
  "commands": ["planning", "kb", "credibility"],
  "interpreters": ["HumanLikeReasoner", "AdvancedReasoner", "deepLLM"],
