  "query_terms": ["evidence", "assumption", "uncertainty", "method", "benchmark", "decision"]
}
@aspect_evidence_status:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by their evidential or assumption-bearing status rather than by runtime component identity alone.
@aspect_evidence_status:inclusion text
Include KUs that justify a method, expose assumptions, preserve uncertainty, or provide decision rationale.
@aspect_evidence_status:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that only name a method or decision without explaining why it matters.
@aspect_evidence_status:protocol text
Prefer KUs that explicitly preserve what is known, what is assumed, and what remains uncertain for the current request.
@aspect_evidence_status:role_vocabulary json
["evidence note", "assumption note", "method note"]
@aspect_evidence_status:query_terms json
["evidence", "assumption", "uncertainty", "method", "benchmark", "decision"]

@aspect_execution_guidance text
Use this aspect when the task needs operational guidance about how a command, interpreter, or prompt asset should be used in execution.
@aspect_execution_guidance:meta json
{
  "rev": 1,
  "status": "approved",
  "aspect_type": "operational",
  "title": "Execution guidance",
  "summary": "Select KUs that prescribe how to use commands, interpreters, caller profiles, or prompt assets during execution.",
  "priority": 10,
  "domains": ["runtime", "planning", "knowledge"],
  "commands": ["planning", "kb", "analytic-memory", "logic-eval", "js-eval", "template-eval", "credibility"],
  "interpreters": ["HumanLikeReasoner", "AdvancedReasoner", "DocumentScalePlanner", "fastLLM", "deepLLM", "writerLLM", "plannerLLM", "codeGeneratorLLM"],
  "tags": ["guidance", "execution", "routing"],
  "query_terms": ["how", "use", "guidance", "execute", "planning", "routing", "prompt"]
}
@aspect_execution_guidance:definition text
This aspect positions KUs by their direct usefulness as execution-time guidance.
@aspect_execution_guidance:inclusion text
Include KUs that tell the runtime when a component should be selected, what input shape it expects, or what output discipline it requires.
@aspect_execution_guidance:exclusion text
Exclude KUs that provide only abstract background without actionable execution guidance.
@aspect_execution_guidance:protocol text
Prefer caller profiles, prompt assets, and command/interpreter guidance KUs whose metadata or body directly constrains the next execution step.
@aspect_execution_guidance:role_vocabulary json
["primary guidance", "prompt asset", "routing cue"]
@aspect_execution_guidance:query_terms json
["guidance", "execution", "use", "routing", "prompt", "input", "output"]

